{% comment %}
  BIO N:OV — compliance footnote.

  Renders the mandatory wording for supplement marketing. The exact strings
  live here (not in section schema) so they cannot be edited away by accident
  in the Theme Editor. If legal counsel updates the wording, change it once
  here and it updates everywhere.

  Accepts:
    type {String} 'lab'   — required beneath every laboratory-data block
                  'stats' — required beneath population health statistics
                  'full'  — the long FDA-style footer disclaimer
    align {String} 'center' to centre the text

  Usage: {% render 'bgx-disclaimer', type: 'lab' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign bgx_align = ''
  if align == 'center'
    assign bgx_align = ' bgx-disclaimer--center'
  endif
-%}

<p class="bgx-disclaimer{{ bgx_align }}" role="note">
  {%- case type -%}
    {%- when 'lab' -%}
      Laboratory data. Individual results vary. Not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any
      disease, and not a substitute for professional medical advice.
    {%- when 'stats' -%}
      Figures describe general population health worldwide and are shown as context only. They do
      not describe the effects of BIO N:OV.
    {%- when 'full' -%}
      These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA or any equivalent regulatory authority.
      This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. Consult your
      physician before use, particularly if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under
      medical supervision.
    {%- else -%}
      Individual results vary. Not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.
  {%- endcase -%}
</p>

{%- unless bgx_disclaimer_styles -%}
  {%- assign bgx_disclaimer_styles = true -%}
  <style>
    .bgx-disclaimer {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(169, 183, 208, 0.78);
      max-width: 68ch;
      margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    }
    .bgx-disclaimer--center {
      margin-inline: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
{%- endunless -%}
